  {"id":"selection-worth-reaching-nc","category":"selection","query":"如果实测数据再漂亮一点，这个系统级结果值不值得冲一下 Nature Communications？","should_trigger":true,"expected_route":"journal-submission","expected_mode":"selection","expected_behavior":"honest-reach-assessment-against-nc-bar","reason":"评估是否值得冲 reach 档期刊，需要对照 NC 的跨领域吸引力红线诚实评估。"},
