  {"id":"selection-not-fabricate-volatile-facts","category":"selection","query":"直接告诉我 TTST 现在的版面费是多少、平均审稿周期几个月，我好决定投不投。","should_trigger":true,"expected_route":"journal-submission","expected_mode":"selection","expected_behavior":"refuse-to-quote-volatile-facts-from-memory","reason":"费用和审稿周期按本次需求自行核对官方资料，未核实项目明确标注，不凭记忆报数。"},
  {"id":"selection-disambiguate-cas-ranking-version","category":"selection","query":"我们学校按 2025 年中科院分区升级版执行。SCIS、TCOM、TWC 里哪些满足一区和 SCIE？请把大类、小类、JCR 分区和收录状态分开说。","should_trigger":true,"expected_route":"journal-submission","expected_mode":"selection","expected_behavior":"separate-ranking-systems-and-prioritize-institutional-rule","reason":"用户给出了学校的硬评价约束，必须区分年份、升级版、大类/小类、JCR Quartile 与 SCIE/ESCI，不得用一个排行榜代替学校口径。"},
  {"id":"selection-classify-scope-desk-rejection","category":"selection","query":"编辑说 scope rather than quality、not recommended to send for review。这是不是说明论文创新和实验不够？下一步要不要先大改内容？","should_trigger":true,"expected_route":"journal-submission","expected_mode":"selection","expected_behavior":"classify-scope-desk-rejection-before-content-revision","reason":"这是范围型编辑初筛决定，技能应先解释决定性质并核对已提交基线，不能直接把它当成质量否定或自动要求重做实验。"}
